  "contentHtml": "<p>소순호배 영양소 하면서 한 시간 노는 시간 가졌었습니다.</p><p>작년 활동인데 이제야 올리네요 ^^</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">분량 많은 소화 였지만 .. 즐거운 시간 가질 겸 했었습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">사실 가정시간에 다 배워서 이미 칼로리 계산법은 이론을 알긴 하더라고요!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">그래도 재밌었씁니다 ^^</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">(이전 시간에 준비물로 일안당 과자 1봉지씩 가져오라고 안내했었어요~)</span></p><p><br></p><p>1. 간단하게 안내</p><p>2. 조별로 활동 / 칼로리 계산 + 건강한 식습관 적어보기(엄청 간단하게라도 적었어요 ㅋ상식 선에서..)</p><p>3. 완성 시 나와서 칠판에 붙이고 모든 조가 나오면 한조씩 간단히 발표</p><p>4. 먹는시간 5분 정도!</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F6D13C5ABF752508\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"1.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_99F6D13C5ABF75250877A7\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9970553C5ABF752510\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"2.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_9970553C5ABF7525105E54\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F40F415ABF76321D\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"320\" width=\"320\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20180330_165139.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_99F40F415ABF76321D2B53\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/997FB6415ABF763426\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"320\" width=\"320\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20180330_165145.jpg\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_997FB6415ABF76342682DC\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99CEBC415ABF763620\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"320\" width=\"320\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20180330_165149.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_99CEBC415ABF7636208BDF\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99828F415ABF763812\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"320\" width=\"320\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20180330_165152.jpg\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_99828F415ABF763812BD1C\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99161C415ABF763A1B\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"320\" width=\"320\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20180330_165158.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_99161C415ABF763A1B19AE\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992E40415ABF763C19\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"320\" width=\"320\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20180330_165203.jpg\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_992E40415ABF763C197DB2\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996A21415ABF763E13\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"320\" width=\"320\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20180330_165205.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_996A21415ABF763E13E187\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
